{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-04-05 18:55:00', 'title': 'CARA THERAPEUTICS SET TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK, APRIL 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CARA THERAPEUTICS INC. (NASD:CARA) WILL REPLACE MTS SYSTEMS CORP. (NASD:MTSC) IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON THURSDAY, APRIL 8. S&P 500 CONSTITUENT AMPHENOL CORP. (NYSE: APH) IS ACQUIRING MTS SYSTEMS IN A DEAL EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED SOON PENDING FINAL CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}